   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empower Under-Resourced Girls in Costa Rica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Soy Nina (I am a Girl) works to empower girls to prevent all types of gender-based violence. We believe that early intervention and prevention is the strongest resource to fight the gender inequality. Our goal is to guide girls into becoming confident and brave. Girls who are self-aware, make informed decisions, and believe in the power of their dreams.</narrative>
  </description>
